.TH geectl-branch-repair-link 1  "geectl-branch-repair-link 0.2.2" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-branch\-repair\-link \- Repair a broken link: strip the failing patches from `_link` server\-side and pin it at a revision where it expands. A mutation: dry\-run is the default
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl branch repair\-link\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-project\fR> <\fB\-\-package\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Repair a broken link: strip the failing patches from `_link` server\-side and pin it at a revision where it expands. A mutation: dry\-run is the default
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-project\fR \fI<PROJECT>\fR
The project holding the package
.TP
\fB\-\-package\fR \fI<PACKAGE>\fR
The package whose link to repair
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH VERSION
v0.2.2
